# Website Theme (Theme_JMLLC001)

Feel: professional, trustworthy, family/legacy-focused, clean, accessible — strong enough for money, warm enough for family.

## Typography

| Role | Font | Use |
|------|------|-----|
| Headlines | **Source Serif 4** | Titles, heroes, section headers, formal legacy copy |
| Body | **Atkinson Hyperlegible Next** | UI text, forms, nav, tables, buttons |

## Colors

| Token | HEX | Use |
|-------|-----|-----|
| Background | `#FFFFFF` | Page background |
| Text | `#0B2545` | Body + headings |
| Primary | `#13366E` | Buttons, links, active, CTAs |
| Accent | `#0E8B8B` | Progress, success, highlights (sparingly) |
| Surface | `#EEF2F6` | Cards, panels |
| Border | `#D5DFEC` | Dividers, inputs |

CSS vars: `--font-headline`, `--font-body`, `--color-background`, `--color-text`, `--color-primary`, `--color-accent`, `--color-surface`, `--color-border`.

## UI patterns

- **Primary button:** primary bg, white text
- **Secondary:** white/surface bg, primary text, border
- **Accent / positive:** accent bg, white text
- **Cards:** surface (or white on surface page) + border; readable spacing
- **Headings:** `font-headline`; body: `font-body`
- **Dialogs:** centered themed modal — never the browser’s `alert()` / `confirm()` / `prompt()` for user-facing copy

## Dialogs

Notices sit in the middle of the screen (dimmed backdrop, theme panel, OK / Cancel). Same chrome as RSVP checkout.

| Need | Use |
|------|-----|
| One-button notice (“Start date is required.”) | `EventsHelpers.alertDialog({ title, message })` |
| Two-button choice (pay, discard, remove) | `EventsHelpers.confirmDialog({ title, message, confirmLabel, cancelLabel })` |
| Brief non-blocking success (“Link copied”) | `EventsHelpers.toast(...)` |

Implemented in `js/components/events/helpers.js` with `.evt-confirm-dialog` styles. Reuse that helper — do not add a second modal system or fall back to native dialogs unless Helpers are missing.

## Logo tones

Navy `#0B2545`, primary `#13366E`, teal accent `#0E8B8B`; white mark on dark.

## Accessibility

- Body text `#0B2545` on white/surface
- Teal for highlights, not long copy
- Clear spacing; keep payment flows simple and direct

Source of truth for implementation: `theme/Theme_JMLLC001/Theme_JMLLC001.css`.
